'''Booklet Islands''' (ブック列島 ''Bukku Rettō'', '''Book Archipelago''') is the 26th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 124th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is relatively elementary in its difficulty, and the stages reflect upon that. The only semi-hard stages would be [[Poetic Death]] for its combo of [[Miss Haka]], [[Fallen Bear]], [[Midnite D.]] and [[Zapy]], which still shouldn't be that complex to beat; and [[Dictionary Estate]], whose combo of [[Medu-san]], [[Dark Dober]] and [[Tarsiriel]] is manageable, but could be challenging if you don't know what you are doing.

